Set \(a_{i, j}:=f\left(v_{i, j}\right)\). Clearly, the labels on the anti-diagonals \(D_{1}\) and \(D_{2}\) satisfy the condition \(a_{2,1}+a_{1,2}=-a_{1,1}\). Employing the local balance condition, for \(k \in\{3, \ldots, m\}\) we obtain the following relations for the labels along
